'''Alternative Elite Skills''': enables using {{Skill pvxicon|Heket's Rampage|12}} as a better IAS, just don't bring another attack skill.
* {{Skill pvxicon|Dark Apostasy|16}}  - If you are playing in an off-meta team and lack an enchantment removal, or there are a lot of enchantments that need to be removed.
* {{Skill pvxicon|Heal as One|12}}  - For bar compression and more damage from pet.
* {{Skill pvxicon|Siphon Strength|4}} - When facing one important boss foe, i.e. Imperial Sanctum. Raise Deadly Arts to 3+1.
* {{Skill pvxicon|Infuriating Heat|5}} - Requires an of Ranger bow grip. Feed the currently broken {{Skill pvxicon|Mighty Throw}}.
'''Optional Non-elite Skills''': 
* {{Skill pvxicon|Edge of Extinction|12}}
* {{Skill pvxicon|Otyugh's Cry|12}} - Prevent pet from getting blocked.
* {{Skill pvxicon|Call of Protection|12}} - Protection for pet.
* {{Skill pvxicon|Critical Defenses|16}} - In areas with problematic melee foes.
* {{Skill pvxicon|Signet of Malice}} or {{Skill pvxicon|Antidote Signet}} - Condition removal.
* {{Skill pvxicon|Resurrection Signet}} - Soft res.

